# The frontend uses relative paths (/api/...) to communicate with backend APIs.
# In Kubernetes, NGINX reverse-proxies these to the respective backend microservices:
#   - /api/converter/*      -> mapping-converter:8000
#   - /api/proposals/*      -> mapping-proposal:8000
#   - /api/version-control/* -> version-control-backend:8080
# In local development, the Vite dev server proxies /api/* to localhost backends.
# No environment variables are required.
#
# (Optional) Playwright E2E configuration:
# PLAYWRIGHT_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4173
# PLAYWRIGHT_SKIP_WEBSERVER=1
